{"id":"a1w4elokzflrm0mly9tftnz2g","title":"BMI 新标准可能翻转数百万肥胖诊断","originalTitle":"STAT+: BMI alternative would flip obesity diagnosis for millions, study finds","summary":"一项发表在《Nature》上的新研究提出，采用新的肥胖诊断标准将导致数百万肥胖患者被重新分类为非肥胖，反之亦然。这可能改善患者的治疗效果，但BMI作为肥胖标准已根深蒂固，涉及监管、保险和医疗资格等多个方面。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"STAT News"},"links":{"original":"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/11/obesity-diagnosis-bmi-lancet-commission-proposal-impact/?utm_campaign=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T16:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T16:45:04.120Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T16:45:04.120Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","The Lancet"],"score":34,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"57ddf14a-929d-410f-8d27-490ed6886b2f","title":"新研究提出替代BMI的标准，或影响数百万诊断"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Andrew Joseph","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"57ddf14a-929d-410f-8d27-490ed6886b2f","title":"新研究提出替代BMI的标准，或影响数百万诊断"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fTs_sMYBarw8","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}